WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.820
What happens to the Twilight Series' "Breaking&nbsp;
Dawn" when it is run through SCP-914?

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:10.800
The Stephenie Meyer novel "Breaking Dawn" was&nbsp;
placed into the Clockworks on the setting "Very&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:15.540
Fine." The output produced was, at first&nbsp;
glance, a copy of the same novel. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:19.200
when a reader picked it up, they would&nbsp;
promptly announce themselves to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:24.900
"Team Edward" or "Team Jacob" and erupt into&nbsp;
violent outbursts toward their opposing group.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:29.400
The effect spread via physical contact,&nbsp;
and spread through the Site before it was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:32.460
eventually contained and the book was destroyed.

